            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Yes, it's true, the time has finally come.<br />\r\nBeetlejuice from the Howard Stern Show has his own wacky, insane, over the top game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the man who sleeps under his bed.<br />\r\nThis is the man who lost 350lbs yet still managed to gain weight. <br />\r\nThis is the man who may or may not have type 16 diabetes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as Beetlejuice, the greatest Wack Packer of all time, in this hilariously wacky Super Mario style adventure.  <br />\r\nWhat does Beetles mind look like?  What goes on there? You're about to find out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have 8 insane Super Power Ups at your disposal.  Use them wisely!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe power ups include:<br />\r\n- StrongBeet<br />\r\n- ArmyBeet<br />\r\n- BunnyBeet<br />\r\n- OgreBeet<br />\r\n- BeetSkywalker<br />\r\n- BigHeadBeet<br />\r\n- TrumpBeet<br />\r\n- MiniMeBeet<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore seven crazy worlds, over 50 levels, fight bosses, find hidden secrets, and save humanity!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(Please support Beetlejuice, 50% of proceeds go to Beetlejuice, his family, and his medical expenses)",
